  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "文字學(一)",
    "sub_ename": "CHINESE SCRIPT(1)",
    "describe_ch": "文字學是中文系基礎課程，無論文學或經學，欲卓然有成，文字學是基本功夫。文字學(一)課程內容包括：一、古文字學概說，引導學生認識甲骨文、金文及簡帛等出土文獻為目標；二、介紹漢字的特質與結構；三、《說文解字》說解漢字的方法；四、漢字的演變，著重文字的起源與漢字的構形演變。",
    "describe_eh": "The philology is the Chinese department foundation curriculum, regardless of the literature or the study of the, want to have remarkably, the philology is the basic kung fu.This curriculum content includes: First, Paleography takes that guide students to understand the goal Unearthed Documents; The second part introduces the characteristics and structure of Chinese characters; Third, \"Shuowen Jiezi\" said the solution Chinese character the method. Fourth, the evolution of Chinese characters, focusing on the origin of words and characters evolve configuration.",
